WEBVTT

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:13.390
Romeo's Blue Skies

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:12.830
"To the Sky..."

00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:17.850
<i>Overlooking the rows of houses and stores</i>

00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:22.260
<i>from the highest vantage,</i>

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:27.370
<i>Such things as tears and sadness</i>

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:31.510
<i>will quickly vanish</i>

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:37.070
<i>The birds, wind, and sunshine...</i>

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:41.260
<i>...all are your friends</i>

00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>I'll carry this dream farther than far</i>

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:51.420
<i>...no matter the distance...</i>

00:00:53.090 --> 00:00:58.180
<i>I long to fly freely</i>

00:00:58.510 --> 00:01:02.460
<i>through the blue sky in my heart...</i>

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:05.390
<i>The far distant blue sky</i>

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:12.840
<i>It flows into tomorrow</i>

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:25.230
Takara Fansubs

00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:32.520
<i>Romeo and the others put their heads together to rescue Bianca.</i>

00:01:32.630 --> 00:01:39.050
<i>And Alfredo protected the medal, his father's keepsake, from Mauricio.</i>

00:01:39.930 --> 00:01:47.220
<i>But after a fleeting reunion with Bianca, he finally collapsed.</i>

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:52.230
Episode 26:

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:52.230
Proud Souls

00:01:53.220 --> 00:01:56.240
What's wrong? Big brother!

00:01:56.480 --> 00:01:58.400
Get a hold of yourself, Alfredo.

00:01:58.470 --> 00:02:00.820
Alfredo!
- Big brother!

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:06.400
Dante, Antonio, make a stretcher.

00:02:06.510 --> 00:02:09.240
Carry Alfredo to Professor Casella's house.

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:10.700
Okay.

00:02:27.300 --> 00:02:31.290
Pia, get some hot water ready.
We'll begin treatment right away.

00:02:31.370 --> 00:02:32.320
Yes, sir.

00:02:44.090 --> 00:02:46.100
Professor.
- How's Alfredo?

00:02:46.230 --> 00:02:48.170
He's fine. He's resting now.

00:02:48.920 --> 00:02:53.460
But he needs peace and quiet, so go home for today.

00:02:54.410 --> 00:02:55.930
Please let me stay.

00:02:57.850 --> 00:03:01.350
Please let her, Professor.
This is Alfredo's sister.

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:13.050
Bianca.
- Big brother!

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:14.530
Big brother!

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:22.860
Big brother.

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:30.160
Alfredo.

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:34.130
Your suffering is over.

00:03:34.570 --> 00:03:35.400
Come along.

00:03:35.910 --> 00:03:38.420
Father... Mother...

00:03:41.730 --> 00:03:43.800
Come along...

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:47.460
Come along...

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:50.640
Father! Mother!

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:22.000
Professor... is Alfredo's sickness...?

00:04:22.050 --> 00:04:22.770
Yes.

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:24.210
It is...!

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:30.710
I hoped to see Alfredo develop into an intelligent young man.

00:04:32.890 --> 00:04:37.560
God gave that boy a terrible fate.

00:04:45.140 --> 00:04:46.250
How are you feeling?

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:50.170
Fine now. Sorry if I worried you.

00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:53.980
It's all right. But I hear you've been pushing yourself too hard.

00:04:55.090 --> 00:04:59.230
How does this boss of yours, Citron, treat you?

00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:02.840
I'll have a look at you now.

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:04.560
Professor...

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:05.270
Hmm?

00:05:05.670 --> 00:05:07.380
I figured it out...

00:05:08.880 --> 00:05:11.510
What's in store for me.

00:05:13.310 --> 00:05:16.970
If that's my destiny, I'm willing to accept it.

00:05:17.590 --> 00:05:19.550
Don't be silly.

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:23.740
All you need is enough time to recuperate and you'll be fine.

00:05:26.030 --> 00:05:28.370
All you need is enough time...

00:05:34.470 --> 00:05:38.040
Professor, I'd like to ask you a favor.

00:05:38.090 --> 00:05:38.950
Yes?

00:05:39.920 --> 00:05:42.980
My sister and I don't have a father or a mother...

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:49.750
If I died, Bianca would be all alone in the world.

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:52.570
My sister...

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:57.240
I want you to take care of my sister.

00:05:57.990 --> 00:05:59.980
Yes, I heard about her from Romeo.

00:06:00.110 --> 00:06:03.260
I've decided to let Bianca stay at my house from now on.

00:06:03.570 --> 00:06:05.020
If that's what you two want.

00:06:09.610 --> 00:06:12.870
You just worry about getting better.

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:16.380
Thank you, Professor.

00:06:22.370 --> 00:06:24.330
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:25.570
Bianca?

00:06:25.680 --> 00:06:27.900
Alfredo! You're finally awake?

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:29.950
I'm fine now.

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:32.620
Really?
- Come in.

00:06:32.710 --> 00:06:35.750
Will the little nurse take care of this patient for me?

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:37.450
Yes...

00:06:42.030 --> 00:06:43.240
Bianca.

00:06:44.390 --> 00:06:49.480
Big brother! Thank goodness...

00:06:49.570 --> 00:06:52.210
Silly, don't be a crybaby.

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:53.030
But...

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:56.620
Don't cry. I'll stay right by your side.

00:07:00.260 --> 00:07:01.380
That's a promise.

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:20.270
Alfredo, Bianca... Diner.

00:07:24.350 --> 00:07:26.160
Professor Casella!

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:33.340
Professor Casella, I can't express my gratitude for your kindness.

00:07:34.530 --> 00:07:40.110
But I'm going back to my padrone.
My contract isn't over yet.

00:07:40.930 --> 00:07:44.500
Please don't tell anyone about my illness.

00:07:46.420 --> 00:07:49.260
Alfredo... You...

00:07:57.590 --> 00:08:01.380
Dante, tell me! What's going to happen to Alfredo?

00:08:02.590 --> 00:08:04.640
I told you. I don't know.

00:08:21.420 --> 00:08:26.640
Alfredo!
- Alfredo!

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:30.410
I'd just come down with a small cold.

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:32.150
But I saw...

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:36.050
Oh, that. I'd bitten my tongue, that's why it was bleeding.

00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:39.670
So it was nothing!
- I'm so glad to hear that.

00:08:39.730 --> 00:08:41.370
I was so worried about you!

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:46.720
I wasn't worried at all. I knew Alfredo would come out okay!

00:08:46.810 --> 00:08:49.920
Liar! Who was it that was crying like a little baby?

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:56.440
But I have to apologize.
I've broken our oath.

00:08:57.190 --> 00:09:00.390
No you haven't, so long as I don't enter the room.

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:01.860
Bianca!

00:09:02.150 --> 00:09:05.850
My selfish sister just won't listen to me. She wants to become one of us.

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:08.370
I'll even sweep chimneys.

00:09:08.450 --> 00:09:10.880
I'll even become a boy if I have to.

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:14.690
No?

00:09:15.420 --> 00:09:17.620
We don't care if you're a girl.

00:09:17.670 --> 00:09:20.250
Yeah! Plus you're Alfredo's sister.

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:22.780
I personally accept you as a special member.

00:09:24.390 --> 00:09:26.260
Are we all agreed?

00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:28.120
Agreed!

00:09:28.450 --> 00:09:30.010
Come on, Bianca.

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:30.890
Thank you.

00:09:31.950 --> 00:09:34.880
Go back to Professor Casella's house for tonight.

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:36.230
Yes.

00:09:36.380 --> 00:09:38.230
So, we got Bianca back...

00:09:38.280 --> 00:09:40.000
And protected the medal!

00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:48.830
It's all over now!

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:52.430
You couldn't even take a simple medal from a kid...

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:55.780
We can't show up at the banquet without the medal.

00:09:56.330 --> 00:10:01.310
If we're branded cheap imposters, forget about wealth and prestige.

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:09.050
Who's that, at this time of night?

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:14.780
Did you make it?

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:16.780
Yes.
- Good. Come in.

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:26.480
Good workmanship, no?

00:10:26.550 --> 00:10:29.410
You made a copy of the original?

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:31.530
I made one better than the original!

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:36.910
You understand, this must be...

00:10:36.950 --> 00:10:39.000
Yes. Nobody will know.

00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:43.980
I told you we'll get everything we want, didn't I, Grazela?

00:10:45.810 --> 00:10:47.220
It's beautiful!

00:10:51.610 --> 00:10:56.370
Bianca and I will sneak into the banquet wearing this medal.

00:10:56.440 --> 00:10:57.490
Into the banquet?

00:10:58.090 --> 00:10:59.700
Wearing that medal?

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:02.630
And we'll tell the King the truth:

00:11:02.700 --> 00:11:07.260
...it was Grazela and Mauricio who killed our parents.

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:09.880
We'll appeal for our innocence.

00:11:10.280 --> 00:11:14.710
The banquet's tightly guarded, so we might not get through to the King.

00:11:14.950 --> 00:11:18.880
But as brother and sister, we're determined to try and pull it off.

00:11:19.210 --> 00:11:21.080
Yes, me too.

00:11:21.170 --> 00:11:22.910
Yeah.
- Me too.

00:11:23.130 --> 00:11:25.310
That's right!
- Let's do it!

00:11:25.310 --> 00:11:26.920
Let's do it!
- Let's do it!

00:11:28.380 --> 00:11:31.350
The pride of the Black Brothers is at stake.

00:11:31.350 --> 00:11:32.410
That's right!

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:34.920
Let's swear an oath!
- An oath!

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:37.060
We'll get Alfredo into the banquet...!

00:11:37.060 --> 00:11:38.980
Together!

00:11:39.070 --> 00:11:40.390
And to the King!

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:45.040
To the King! To the King!

00:11:57.050 --> 00:12:00.580
<i>In order to get Alfredo and Bianca to the wedding banquet,</i>

00:12:01.060 --> 00:12:04.770
<i>...the boys passionately set themselves to the task.</i>

00:12:05.520 --> 00:12:11.070
This is Duke Christofol's mansion where the banquet will be held.

00:12:11.140 --> 00:12:13.340
The question is how to get in.

00:12:13.490 --> 00:12:16.030
What about the sewer?

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:19.600
The sewer probably doesn't pass under here.

00:12:19.860 --> 00:12:22.440
Suppose we cause a commotion here.

00:12:22.640 --> 00:12:25.400
And then sneak in while the adults are distracted.

00:12:25.710 --> 00:12:28.150
That's good! I like that idea.

00:12:31.190 --> 00:12:33.350
You're good, Michaelo.

00:12:33.510 --> 00:12:36.000
I used to help my mother with it.

00:12:36.130 --> 00:12:39.330
You're making a coat to wear to the banquet.

00:12:39.770 --> 00:12:43.580
We've got to look our best if we'll be meeting the King.

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:48.720
He's mending old clothes. I'll bet it's going to look lovely.

00:12:53.980 --> 00:12:56.120
That's the front gate.

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:57.450
It's well guarded.

00:12:57.530 --> 00:12:58.370
Yes.

00:12:58.480 --> 00:13:01.430
The guard will be even tighter the night of the banquet.

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:14.730
I'll nab a few apples from the fruit shop there...

00:13:21.210 --> 00:13:24.640
I'm looking for Lorenzo the cook.

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:28.080
Lorenzo the cook.

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:37.690
Hey. Hurry up!

00:13:48.190 --> 00:13:49.110
Hey!

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:51.980
What are you doing over there?

00:13:52.480 --> 00:13:55.130
Cleaning chimneys, what else?

00:13:55.530 --> 00:13:57.800
Spatza Camino!

00:13:58.460 --> 00:13:59.890
Spatza Camino!

00:14:00.180 --> 00:14:02.870
Want your chimneys cleaned?

00:14:03.460 --> 00:14:06.370
Spatza Camino!

00:14:07.230 --> 00:14:09.760
<i>And so the plan unfolded.</i>

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:15.760
<i>The Black Brothers grew closer and became more courageous every day.</i>

00:14:29.490 --> 00:14:30.660
Watch out!

00:14:30.790 --> 00:14:36.100
<i>And finally the day of the banquet was one day away.</i>

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:40.560
Tomorrow's the day.

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:42.410
Our plan is perfect.

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:45.320
The Black Brothers are one!

00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:46.400
One!

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:51.180
Big brother, your suit is done!

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:00.420
Bianca.

00:15:02.090 --> 00:15:04.180
How's it going, Bianca?

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:13.270
So, tomorrow's the day, Bianca.

00:15:13.730 --> 00:15:14.810
Uh-huh.

00:15:15.450 --> 00:15:17.410
Are you mad about something?

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:22.720
Bianca...

00:15:22.920 --> 00:15:26.670
You used to pay attention only to me.

00:15:27.550 --> 00:15:29.420
But now all you do is talk to Romeo!

00:15:33.940 --> 00:15:37.120
Romeo... Do you really think Romeo's that great?

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:39.470
Yes. I do.

00:15:40.050 --> 00:15:44.370
I don't hold a candle to Romeo.
Honestly I believe that.

00:15:45.030 --> 00:15:46.860
But that's not true...

00:15:47.890 --> 00:15:51.090
You're much greater, big brother.

00:15:54.990 --> 00:16:00.740
Bianca... I wish you'd understand how much I trust Romeo.

00:16:04.070 --> 00:16:08.500
Romeo doesn't even realize he's tremendously kind.

00:16:09.760 --> 00:16:13.790
Romeo is the only brave one.

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:17.830
I think you'll grow to like Romeo someday.

00:16:20.740 --> 00:16:23.620
No, I won't.

00:16:24.770 --> 00:16:26.200
Alfredo...

00:16:28.050 --> 00:16:30.150
We're all ready.

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:38.060
I hate you, big brother!
You say such stupid things.

00:16:38.550 --> 00:16:41.230
What's wrong?
- Who knows...

00:16:42.120 --> 00:16:45.070
I wonder how you two will turn out...

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:53.340
I wish I would have been able to see you as an adult.

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:02.370
Alfredo... Are you...

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:05.680
Let's give it our best shot tomorrow.

00:17:05.680 --> 00:17:07.220
Sure.

00:17:09.030 --> 00:17:10.420
Alfredo...

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:25.490
Let's do it!

00:17:33.100 --> 00:17:35.880
Man! I'm starting to feel excited!

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:36.890
Me too!

00:17:37.420 --> 00:17:40.840
Then we all meet tomorrow in the park, as planned.

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:41.800
Yeah.

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:44.780
Well, see you tomorrow.

00:17:44.780 --> 00:17:46.210
Yeah. See you.

00:18:00.190 --> 00:18:05.520
Alfredo... I haven't forgotten you.

00:18:06.160 --> 00:18:10.550
Plenty of guys will crawl and beg once you hit them once or twice.

00:18:11.210 --> 00:18:13.410
But this guy's different.

00:18:13.740 --> 00:18:18.310
Alfredo... making guys like you crawl is my greatest joy.

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:23.550
We'll settle it once and for all.

00:18:42.660 --> 00:18:43.830
Go. Shoo.

00:18:47.420 --> 00:18:49.560
You stupid stray!

00:18:50.130 --> 00:18:51.940
Are you crazy!?

00:18:52.100 --> 00:18:54.120
You all right, Nikita?

00:18:55.490 --> 00:18:57.190
I've survived worse.

00:18:57.190 --> 00:18:58.220
Were you waiting for me?

00:18:59.350 --> 00:19:03.360
No, I was NOT! I was just passing by.

00:19:04.350 --> 00:19:06.200
So... better?

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:09.550
Are you feeling better?

00:19:09.860 --> 00:19:13.170
Oh, I'm fine now.

00:19:14.050 --> 00:19:16.140
Really? So you're okay now?

00:19:16.910 --> 00:19:19.890
Thank you. I knew from the beginning...

00:19:20.460 --> 00:19:23.090
...deep down, you were a nice person.

00:19:23.950 --> 00:19:25.030
I don't...

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:29.410
I haven't forgotten the promise I made you here before.

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:31.400
Promise...?

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:39.570
I said you would look pretty with a flower in your hair one day...

00:19:39.880 --> 00:19:43.450
And I'd come running to see you if you did.

00:19:44.670 --> 00:19:46.630
So... is that going to happen any time soon?

00:19:49.230 --> 00:19:54.320
Hmph! You sweet-talker.
Just as soon as hell freezes over.

00:20:05.320 --> 00:20:06.950
Hey. What's wrong?

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:08.510
Alfredo.

00:20:12.200 --> 00:20:14.050
Are you all right?

00:20:15.570 --> 00:20:17.130
Use this.

00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:27.600
You... you're not better at all!

00:20:29.170 --> 00:20:30.090
That's it!

00:20:33.990 --> 00:20:38.360
Do... Don't say it. Please.

00:20:40.610 --> 00:20:42.150
Alfredo.

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:45.210
Don't worry about me.

00:20:45.960 --> 00:20:48.100
I'll get you some water.

00:20:57.030 --> 00:21:00.640
<i>I can't give in now.</i>

00:21:01.880 --> 00:21:05.580
<i>There's something I have to do first.</i>

00:21:19.530 --> 00:21:23.590
Yo. I've been waiting for you, Alfredo.

00:21:27.620 --> 00:21:29.230
Giovanni.

00:21:38.380 --> 00:21:47.390
<i>A day before the banquet, an inexplicable sensation of fear arose in Romeo's heart.</i>

00:21:55.170 --> 00:21:57.330
<i>Finally, it's the day of the banquet.</i>

00:21:57.580 --> 00:22:01.260
<i>But though we waited and waited, Alfredo didn't show up.</i>

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:03.730
<i>I wonder if something happened?</i>

00:22:04.390 --> 00:22:07.560
<i>Everyone, I'm going to look for Alfredo.</i>

00:22:08.180 --> 00:22:12.480
See you then!

00:22:08.180 --> 00:22:12.480
<i>The Start of a Long Day</i>

00:22:08.180 --> 00:22:12.480
Next time:

00:22:14.080 --> 00:22:18.080
<i>"Si Si Ciao ~ On These Roman Roofs"</i>

00:22:26.690 --> 00:22:30.790
<i>Si Si Ciao, why do the good times</i>

00:22:30.890 --> 00:22:35.090
<i>seem to end so soon?</i>

00:22:35.290 --> 00:22:39.290
<i>Si Si Ciao, we're all friends</i>

00:22:39.490 --> 00:22:43.490
<i>Let's meet again on these Roman roofs</i>

00:22:44.100 --> 00:22:48.400
<i>Your laughing voice dances</i>

00:22:48.400 --> 00:22:52.300
<i>Once again in the sky</i>

00:22:52.700 --> 00:22:59.600
<i>Your pocket bursting with memories</i>

00:23:01.300 --> 00:23:05.200
<i>Si Si Ciao, goodbye but for now</i>

00:23:05.400 --> 00:23:09.400
<i>Let's meet again on these Roman roofs</i>
